text:
It is terrible to see one prediction that we made early at
@MixModeAI
come true: AI based attacks that often use novel penetration pathways have now become the norm, not an exception, as the latest hack on the Australian health care system shows https://t.co/RtUiGo9vEf. The swarm of agents exchanged information to find pathways that other agents did not, finally getting their way through.  Rules can not encompass all the exponentially possible ways agents can come through. The only way to protect against these is AI based detection of novel, abnormal behavior. #AI #Cybersecurity
